1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,223
Kertas ini,

2
00:00:02,342 --> 00:00:03,166
dia yang buat.

3
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:05,442
Kertas putih Liuxi?

4
00:00:06,093 --> 00:00:06,934
Murid Xu Yan,

5
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:08,009
mohon Guru Besar menjamin saya.

6
00:00:08,316 --> 00:00:10,038
Jaminan dicabut menjelang ujian,

7
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,511
pasti ada sebabnya.

8
00:00:11,682 --> 00:00:12,885
Tintanya nggak merembes,

9
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:14,577
pembuatnya tak menipu orang.

10
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:16,012
Baik.

11
00:00:16,183 --> 00:00:18,198
Saya uji kau satu soal.

12
00:00:18,269 --> 00:00:19,961
Kemarau tanpa hujan,

13
00:00:20,027 --> 00:00:21,587
dari mana sawah dapat air?

14
00:00:22,388 --> 00:00:23,641
Sungai di bawah,

15
00:00:23,887 --> 00:00:25,245
sawah di atas.

16
00:00:25,443 --> 00:00:26,508
Maka biarkan airnya

17
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:28,047
naik sendiri.

18
00:00:28,296 --> 00:00:30,388
Liuxi membongkar balok rumah abu leluhur,

19
00:00:30,457 --> 00:00:31,750
untuk membuat kincir air ini.

20
00:00:31,812 --> 00:00:32,801
Liuxi dapat air,

21
00:00:33,487 --> 00:00:35,019
ternyata karena kau.

22
00:00:35,078 --> 00:00:36,017
Jaminan ini,

23
00:00:36,072 --> 00:00:37,123
saya yang tanggung.

24
00:00:39,827 --> 00:00:41,051
Gu-Guru Besar Cheng?

25
00:00:41,713 --> 00:00:42,939
Cabut jaminan tanpa tanya alasan,

26
00:00:43,937 --> 00:00:46,186
begini caramu bekerja?

27
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:47,061
Hamba salah!

28
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:48,445
Segera hamba isi lagi!

29
00:00:48,515 --> 00:00:50,261
Orang Kabupaten Qingshui,

30
00:00:50,339 --> 00:00:52,211
pantas dijamin Guru Besar?

31
00:00:52,381 --> 00:00:54,207
Sampai jumpa di ujian.

32
00:01:00,539 --> 00:01:01,673
Pakaian itu…

33
00:01:02,113 --> 00:01:03,216
orang keluarga Wei.

34
00:01:03,644 --> 00:01:04,245
Aku ingat kau.

35
00:01:07,258 --> 00:01:07,586
Tuan,

36
00:01:07,772 --> 00:01:08,673
di sini bocor.

37
00:01:09,322 --> 00:01:10,339
Bilik tak bisa ditukar,

38
00:01:10,402 --> 00:01:11,453
urus sendiri.

39
00:01:11,514 --> 00:01:12,664
Bocor, bagus.

40
00:01:12,823 --> 00:01:13,931
Aku boleh basah,

41
00:01:13,988 --> 00:01:15,980
lembar ujian jangan.

42
00:01:17,992 --> 00:01:18,483
Kumpulkan!

43
00:01:18,664 --> 00:01:20,518
Tiga tahap ujian provinsi,

44
00:01:20,588 --> 00:01:23,073
semuanya selesai.

45
00:01:24,701 --> 00:01:25,162
Kabupaten Qingshui,

46
00:01:27,263 --> 00:01:28,506
Xu Yan.

47
00:01:30,506 --> 00:01:31,699
Karangan bagus.

48
00:01:31,862 --> 00:01:33,609
Sayang sekali.

49
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,650
Mulai hari ini,

50
00:01:36,972 --> 00:01:39,056
namamu Wei Xun.
